{"id":"selon","lemma":"selon","pos":"prep","rank":607,"glosses":["according to; whichever applies; depending on"],"ipa":"/sə.lɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/80/Fr-selon.ogg/Fr-selon.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Selon lui, elle est honnête.","en":"According to him, she is honest.","words":[null,{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"honest"}]},{"text":"Après quoi en ont-ils, selon vous ?","en":"What do you think they're after?","words":[null,null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"you"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"after which"]]},{"text":"Quel est le meilleur plan, selon toi ?","en":"Which plan do you believe is better?","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"best, better"},{"g":"map"},null,{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Conduis-toi selon ton âge.","en":"Act your age.","words":[{"g":"to drive","l":"conduire"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"your"},{"g":"age"}]},{"text":"Ai-je l'air mort, selon vous ?","en":"Do I look dead to you?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"air"},{"g":"dead"},null,{"g":"you"}]}]}